  "summary": "The Gospels name Andrew among Jesus's first followers and the Twelve. His brief appearances show him called alongside Peter and later included among the disciples gathered after Jesus's ascension.",
  "historical_context": "Matthew 4:18-22 places Andrew fishing with Peter when Jesus calls them to follow him. Luke 6:12-16 includes Andrew in the list of the Twelve, and Acts 1:13 names him among the disciples gathered in Jerusalem after Jesus's ascension. These passages establish his place in the story but provide little individual biography.",
